  "seoBody": "<p>Choosing a tool to write your inspection reports? Here is a straight answer on when Quickler suits you, and when another tool does.</p><h2>What Quickler does differently</h2><ul><li><strong>You use WhatsApp.</strong> No new app to install. No login for the person on site.</li><li><strong>£75 per month per phone number & unlimited free dashboard accounts.</strong> Reports, the dashboard, sharing and downloads are free for everyone else. Paid accounts have no limits: reports, photos and messages are unlimited. Start with a 14-day free trial. Everything is unlocked and you need no card to start.</li><li><strong>Voice notes are written out.</strong> You can speak your answers.</li><li><strong>It fills in your own report.</strong> Send a finished one in Word or PDF and every new one comes back in that layout.</li></ul><h2>When Quickler suits you</h2><ul><li>You run the same kind of walk again and again.</li><li>You spend hours turning notes and photos into a report.</li><li>You want to Pay for each phone number on the account.</li></ul><h2>When another tool is better</h2><p>You need scheduling, quoting and invoicing in one place: look at SimPro, Joblogic or Fergus. You want the biggest shelf of ready-made templates: look at Mitti, formerly SafetyCulture. You need many UK certificate formats or full fleet management: use a dedicated tool.</p>",
